    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550280/extras/928adbc726f4ea42bcb05c2db2a1e5f7.avif?t=1754486171\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The perfect 1v1 mini games galore for casual scrubs like us. You and your sibling are tasked to complete certain chores before your mom returns home. Let them know you are THE superior sibling.\u00a0Be the one to complete more assignments so you can get all the love from mommy. You can choose to do either of these things at a given time: </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>COMPLETE CHORES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To win the game, you will need to complete more tasks than your sibling. These are simple tasks such as cleaning the toilet, putting fruits on the fridge, and many more. Failure to do any task by the end of the day will automatically eliminate you from the family. Jk. You just lose that round and an immediate guarantee that you won't get cuddled by mommy, that's all.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550280/extras/dc2de58d462151523547bc83a4cedaee.poster.avif?t=1754486171\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550280/extras/dc2de58d462151523547bc83a4cedaee.webm?t=1754486171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550280/extras/dc2de58d462151523547bc83a4cedaee.mp4?t=1754486171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>WHACK A SIBLING</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you meet your sibling when you are about to do your daily task, you can smack them with the fly swatter. Remember, if you get hit, you will be temporarily stunned for a few seconds, which makes them have the upper hand in completing their tasks. I say we strike FIRST, always.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550280/extras/94a2a9a9607b198d6d10fce91bad6bb8.poster.avif?t=1754486171\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550280/extras/94a2a9a9607b198d6d10fce91bad6bb8.webm?t=1754486171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550280/extras/94a2a9a9607b198d6d10fce91bad6bb8.mp4?t=1754486171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>SABOTAGE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The art of getting praised is to make it look like you are the only one doing them. You can pay your dearest sibling a visit and let them know who's the alpha by ruining their tasks within the 3 seconds window that you have, so they outta spend more time doing that task.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550280/extras/839e5da1921dd6d3eeca141331b9150b.poster.avif?t=1754486171\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550280/extras/839e5da1921dd6d3eeca141331b9150b.webm?t=1754486171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550280/extras/839e5da1921dd6d3eeca141331b9150b.mp4?t=1754486171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>WHAT'S IN THIS GAME?</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 characters\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 mini games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter Egg (?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That's all you gotta do to win mommy's heart. Do you have what it takes to be the favorite child?\u00a0</strong></p>",
